  <section class="qa-sources qa-section" aria-labelledby="src-h2">
    <h2 id="src-h2">Sources</h2>
    <ol class="qa-src-list">
      <li id="src-1">Madge, S. & Burn, H. (1994). <em>Crows and Jays: A Guide to the Crows, Jays and Magpies of the World</em>. Christopher Helm. — size, identification, ecology and distribution of Corvidae including ravens and jays.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="qa-claim-note"><strong class="claim-science">[science]</strong> peer-reviewed or field-guide data</p>
  </section>

